      "name": "REQ_027",
      "label": "\n\t\t\t\t<B>Requirement</B><BR/>\n\t\t\t\t<B>Audit Trail and Versioning</B><BR/>\n\t\t\t\t<BR/>\n\t\t\t\tAll Aurora cards SHALL include an audit_trail with a per-card SemVer version, an<BR/> optional SHA256 hash (nullable), and a chronological history of created/edited/<BR/>deleted events including editor identity and RFC3339 timestamps.<BR/>\n\t\t\t",
